@PharmacyBilling.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5203

### Register a medicine
POST {{PharmacyBilling.Api_HostAddress}}/api/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MED-100",
  "name": "Amoxicillin 500mg",
  "unitPrice": 2.50
}

### Receive stock (replace the medicine id with the one returned above)
POST {{PharmacyBilling.Api_HostAddress}}/api/medicines/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "batchNumber": "B-001",
  "expiryDate": "2027-06-30",
  "quantity": 50
}

### Stock levels
GET {{PharmacyBilling.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/stock-levels?lowStockThreshold=20

###

### Expiry report
GET {{PharmacyBilling.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/expiry-report?withinDays=30

###
